[{"client_msg_id":"f8927043-6ef5-4998-9de6-2b2986b662fb","type":"message","user":"U02EKL7FDBR","text":"いえいえ、ありがとうありがとうございます。","ts":"1637401733.179300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RarF4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9020d009-f19a-4e63-a29c-2762a2f987b7","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"早とちりしてしまった。ごめんなさい","ts":"1637401704.178800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MqS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f4c16c9-46e3-4159-bf63-52ff47a484c4","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"この問題が起きたときに手動で`lightline#update()` を実行するとlightlineが読み直されて正常に戻る、でもこれをイベントにhookして実行させるとうまくいかない、って結論だったと記憶してます。\n今回の場合、`previm` は入れてないようなので原因はこれじゃなさそうですね","ts":"1637401669.178300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q67"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc3798a2-a33e-4729-960f-aae8cb98c7cb","type":"message","user":"U02EKL7FDBR","text":"このissuesだと、previm内の`autocmd` が良くなかったってことになるなぁ……\n何が原因かつきとめるの大変だ","ts":"1637401431.176000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OsW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38644a93-77c2-4201-9daa-ca4a78980ed6","type":"message","user":"U02EKL7FDBR","text":"previmは入れてないんですよね。\nこれって、`autocmd` で`lightline#update()` を呼び出しているのが原因と思っていいんでしょうか？","ts":"1637401085.172900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IMrYl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b77d994-6da4-4b05-8d53-d99493412b10","type":"message","user":"U02EKL7FDBR","text":"ちょっと確認してみます。","ts":"1637399437.170600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rvVq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69b0ad24-cedc-4a07-bd08-8d2b142d55f6","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"もしそうだったらこれかもしれないです\n\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/dein.vim/issues/427\u003e","ts":"1637399411.170200","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"778x846px image","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/dein.vim/issues/427|#427 Lazy loaded previm breaks lightline.vim when displaying function information by LSP\u003e","text":"*Problems summary*\n\nLazy loaded previm breaks lightline.vim when displaying function information by LSP.\n\n*Expected*\n\nlightline.vim show mode, filetype etc always.\n\n*Environment Information (Required!)*\n\n• dein.vim version(SHA1): \u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/dein.vim/commit/ee6a5fcecb1c5da6976f8e7dc65cf7a14b48fe14|ee6a5fc\u003e\n• OS: Manjaro\n• Vim/neovim version: NVIM v0.6.0-dev+43-g02bf251bb\n\n*Provide a minimal .vimrc with less than 50 lines (Required!)*\n\n(`init.vim`)\n\n```\nset runtimepath^=~/.config/nvim/dein/repos/github.com/Shougo/dein.vim/\nif dein#load_state('~/.config/nvim/dein')\n  call dein#begin('~/.config/nvim/dein')\n  call dein#add('prabirshrestha/vim-lsp')\n  call dein#add('mattn/vim-lsp-settings')\n  call dein#add('itchyny/lightline.vim')\n  call dein#add('previm/previm', {'lazy': 1, 'on_ft': 'markdown'})\n  call dein#end()\n  call dein#save_state()\nendif\nset laststatus=2\n```\n\nNote: If set previm to \"non-lazy\", this problem does not occur.\n\n*The reproduce ways from Vim starting (Required!)*\n\n1. `:call dein#install()`\n2. Restart vim and execute `:set filetype=python`.\n3. execute `:LspInstallServer pylsp-all` for install Langage server.\n4. execute `:edit foo.py` and write `print(`. The function information will be displayed.\n5. At the same time, mode, filetype etc is disappear.\n\nNote: This problem also occurs with other file types and language server combinations. For example, `foo.ts` and `deno`.\n\n*Screen shot (if possible)*\n\nThis is a gif after step 2.\n\n\u003chttps://camo.githubusercontent.com/9e180047a2638af5dbc305e6b00fe31791b8e86ef8bd294d92cc066d3db29f70/68747470733a2f2f692e6779617a6f2e636f6d2f35353064616338633836613034323631633630313761303661373563356439392e676966|https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9e180047a2638af5dbc305e6b00fe31791b8e86ef8bd294d92cc066d3db29f70/68747470733a2f2f692e6779617a6f2e636f6d2f35353064616338633836613034323631633630313761303661373563356439392e676966\u003e","image_url":"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9e180047a2638af5dbc305e6b00fe31791b8e86ef8bd294d92cc066d3db29f70/68747470733a2f2f692e6779617a6f2e636f6d2f35353064616338633836613034323631633630313761303661373563356439392e676966","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"cannot fix","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"3","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/dein.vim|Shougo/dein.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1631362650}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YxQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5973270-ec68-4395-aed1-207a0acc8f0c","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"previmをlazyで入れてませんか？","ts":"1637399333.169700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"598s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59a5bac4-98fa-4214-a015-a353403bd34d","type":"message","user":"U02EKL7FDBR","text":"しかも、起動後一回目だけその挙動になるんで、気にしなければそれでおしまいなんですよねぇ","ts":"1637399310.169300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZLaL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8214abed-4a87-4f0f-aff1-231a2b60623f","type":"message","user":"U02EKL7FDBR","text":"今、vim-lspに切り替えてみたんですが、\n関数のヒントをfloating-windowで表示してくれるときに、\nlightlineが外れるんですよねぇ……\n一応回避策はあって、lightlineを弄るとき用のコマンドを作って置いたので、\nそれを使えばlightlineが再表示してくれるんで、元に戻せない訳じゃないんですよねぇ……","ts":"1637399177.167100","edited":{"user":"U02EKL7FDBR","ts":"1637399362.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HcsK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"943f35af-a3c6-4ce4-aec9-88e2134c7a23","type"